  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The information given only tells us that Mr. Jackson’s class has 28 students. It does not provide the price of a pack of glue sticks or any related cost information.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Changing the class size from 28 to 27 students does not provide the price of a pack of glue sticks. No cost or other relevant information is given.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information provided.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "There are 27 students, and each pack contains 9 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 9 = 3\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need 3 packs. However, the price of each pack is not given.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information provided.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "With 27 students and 8 glue sticks per pack:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 8 = 3\\text{ remainder }3\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need 4 packs. However, the price per pack is not provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for **$6**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Since the store charges **$6 per pack** and does not offer discounts, the retail price of one pack is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each of the 27 students needs 2 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\times 2 = 54 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\nEach pack contains 8 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n54 \\div 8 = 6.75\n\\]\n\nSince Mr. Jackson can buy only whole packs, he must round up to 7 packs. These provide:\n\n\\[\n7 \\times 8 = 56 \\text{ glue sticks}\n\\]\n\nSo, he will have 2 glue sticks left over.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
